// Committed — this is the Release/Archive config file, deliberately
// containing no secret. Insights narration (OpenAI gpt-5.6-terra) needs a
// key; shipping it inside the binary is not safe (see Secrets.local.xcconfig,
// which does that for local Debug builds only). Every archived/TestFlight/
// App Store build resolves OPENAI_API_KEY to empty here, so
// InsightsService.isConfigured is false and the app falls back to its
// deterministic facts sections — narration comes back once the backend
// proxy (api/insights-narrate) ships.
OPENAI_API_KEY =
